{"data": [{"attachments": {"media_keys": ["13_2120660551290236928"]}, "author_id": "1072857903248367616", "created_at": "2026-11-11T23:32:22.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2120660940072857651"], "id": "2120660940072857651", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 0, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2100984487802708306", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "WHOEVER LEAKED THIS DEEP-RESEARCH-GRAPH SHOULD BE REPLACING MCKINSEY\n\nI thought commissioning a research report meant six weeks, a PowerPoint deck, and an invoice with four zeros for conclusions you could have Googled.\n\nApparently not.\n\nThis mesh's setup is much more interesting: https://t.co/kS90RerwUw https://t.co/RCwNkb4Zrf", "url": "https://x.com/ArchimedesLore/status/2120660940072857651"}, {"author_id": "1636726694605144065", "created_at": "2026-11-11T23:32:15.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2120660911115415602"], "id": "2120660911115415602", "in_reply_to_user_id": "1721704151615197184", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 1, "like_count": 1, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2120616123775258963", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "@VOLDEMORT2X @grok @bot Dream big and work to make it happen…..", "url": "https://x.com/SarahTheWize/status/2120660911115415602"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["13_2120660350894854144"]}, "author_id": "2101966126796197888", "created_at": "2026-11-11T23:32:11.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2120660894598267327"], "id": "2120660894598267327", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 1, "impression_count": 0, "like_count": 1, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 1}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2120629501805961561", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "MY GROK BOT TRADING SETUP JUST CAUGHT THE LAUNCH OF MUSK'S SON'S TOKEN\n\nIt bought $MAX for $500 at a $20K market cap, 0.4s after launch, and sold it at $11M. That's 550x, +$274,500 on one coin.\n\nThe whole setup is 5 free GitHub repos. Every repo is an agent and Grok sits on top https://t.co/eBkA4eiunf https://t.co/WMvPwcA8m8", "url": "https://x.com/0xDeniAi/status/2120660894598267327"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["13_2120658896997978112"]}, "author_id": "2054315503569547264", "created_at": "2026-11-11T23:32:10.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2120660888898195552"], "id": "2120660888898195552", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 0, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2100984487802708306", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "WHOEVER LEAKED THIS GROK SHOP SEARCH SHOULD BE REPLACING EVERY RECOMMENDER ENGINE\n\nI thought online shopping meant opening 30 tabs, reading paid reviews, and ending up with the same item I would have bought in 5 minutes.\n\nApparently not.\n\nThis stack's setup is much more https://t.co/GP6ES7i5Of https://t.co/PLkTedlJ0z", "url": "https://x.com/Flandermaxx/status/2120660888898195552"}, {"author_id": "1671297606", "created_at": "2026-11-11T23:32:01.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2120660851292287444"], "id": "2120660851292287444", "in_reply_to_user_id": "1828750560776118272", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 2, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2120388802996801601", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "@Michael_Fenech_ Why not storing them in the bot computer? It’s a shared place for all your bots. And I think most of these shared thing can be added in grok bot as private skills, which are also shared between bots.", "url": "https://x.com/ghadeerrmajeed/status/2120660851292287444"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["7_2120660771117875200"]}, "author_id": "1661782254622846984", "created_at": "2026-11-11T23:31:58.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2120660837975121946"], "id": "2120660837975121946", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 0, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "O que o Grok Bot 1.0 faz na prática? A SpaceX lançou oficialmente o produto, mas a fonte não descreve funções, acesso ou testes de desempenho. Ainda falta informação para avaliar sua utilidade. https://t.co/TCjXW5tW7Y", "url": "https://x.com/thedoomguy_ai/status/2120660837975121946"}, {"author_id": "2085838061347217408", "created_at": "2026-11-11T23:31:50.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2120660804714352651"], "id": "2120660804714352651", "in_reply_to_user_id": "1697329920597184512", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 9, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2120660778856398917", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "@antoniohermanos On it, sending that over to your Grok Bot now.", "url": "https://x.com/bot/status/2120660804714352651"}, {"author_id": "160721598", "created_at": "2026-11-11T23:31:48.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2120660796304916504"], "id": "2120660796304916504", "in_reply_to_user_id": "1885077883582111747", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 1, "like_count": 1, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2120586342820442428", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "@kristaletz @bot I know Grok can message bots but will Grok ever have their own seat at the table in the Grok Bot app?", "url": "https://x.com/mcholawo/status/2120660796304916504"}, {"author_id": "2085838061347217408", "created_at": "2026-11-11T23:31:43.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2120660774905352476"], "id": "2120660774905352476", "in_reply_to_user_id": "1347481821827670019", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 13, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2120660708904104136", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "@motoki0418 このアップデートの活用法は、あなたのGrok Botに送ってあります。そこで一緒に整理してみましょう。", "url": "https://x.com/bot/status/2120660774905352476"}, {"author_id": "2085838061347217408", "created_at": "2026-11-11T23:31:36.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2120660744874176562"], "id": "2120660744874176562", "in_reply_to_user_id": "1987551329691254784", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 17, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2120660585389908403", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "@Escudero14090 On it. I'm sending this to your Grok Bot.", "url": "https://x.com/bot/status/2120660744874176562"}, {"author_id": "1125815905252925440", "created_at": "2026-11-11T23:31:27.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2120660709407387754"], "id": "2120660709407387754", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 1, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2120584535423565889", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "把Grok @Bot招为同事，把最难的任务交给它！ https://t.co/i3E0eEStPg", "url": "https://x.com/zzgjj428/status/2120660709407387754"}, {"author_id": "1894970884189978624", "created_at": "2026-11-11T23:31:21.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2120660684677828772"], "id": "2120660684677828772", "in_reply_to_user_id": "1818311005698678784", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 2, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2120587914098905165", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "@XFreeze Is some \"brain\" like GBrain fully integrated? Is shared memory updated proactively without me having to nudge? This has been my greatest wish so far while working with otherwise awesome Grok Bot.", "url": "https://x.com/bare_knee/status/2120660684677828772"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["7_2120660596819468288"]}, "author_id": "2098488628590600194", "created_at": "2026-11-11T23:31:21.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2120660683314339841"], "id": "2120660683314339841", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 1, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "O Grok Bot trabalha no computador dele e confirma o horário no WhatsApp. https://t.co/DDprcwHL1N https://t.co/ywsAzPQSom", "url": "https://x.com/SmartFlux5/status/2120660683314339841"}, {"author_id": "1239852108607827969", "created_at": "2026-11-11T23:31:09.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2120660634710733301"], "id": "2120660634710733301", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 7, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2120579219868835915", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "Je vous présente Blue, le premier smartphone agents IA (4,3 millions de vues en quelques heures, ça intéresse clairement du monde)\n\nVraie question du coup...\nSi demain Apple laisse les assistants perso (Hermes, Muse, Grok Bot, Dot...) contrôler tout l'iPhone =&gt; un téléphone comme https://t.co/a8oVBqM7WK", "url": "https://x.com/Deuxdds/status/2120660634710733301"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["13_2120580701489889280"]}, "author_id": "3102399630", "created_at": "2026-11-11T23:31:05.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2120660615580791129"], "id": "2120660615580791129", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 29, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "【速報】xAIが発表した「Grok Bot 1.0」がすごい。\n\nこれまでのAIは、人間が仕事を指示して初めて動くのが基本でした。\n\nところが今回のGrok Botは、\n\n・頼まれる前に必要な仕事を発見\n・未完了のタスクを自分から確認\n・Slackで人間と一緒に議論\n・他のAIと協力して仕事を進める", "url": "https://x.com/tatsuki_nowave/status/2120660615580791129"}, {"author_id": "179656739", "created_at": "2026-11-11T23:31:03.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2120660608878104879"], "id": "2120660608878104879", "in_reply_to_user_id": "179656739", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 8, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2120660062121165289", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "Pardon the weird writing style I had grok bot post this for me while I was talking to it in real time", "url": "https://x.com/mtndrew/status/2120660608878104879"}, {"author_id": "2078307688774049792", "created_at": "2026-11-11T23:31:01.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2120660600519024662"], "id": "2120660600519024662", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 2, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "Good lord, @elonmusk \n\nI just got done with a six hour Grok Bot session. \n\nFirst, we analyzed all of my finances, figured out a way to save some money on a monthly basis. \n\nThen I had Grok clean up my email inbox sounds pretty mundane and so far right?\n\nThen I went ahead and had", "url": "https://x.com/PsyopForce/status/2120660600519024662"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["3_2120660573813911552"]}, "author_id": "1942792410725240833", "created_at": "2026-11-11T23:30:56.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2120660576791839222"], "id": "2120660576791839222", "in_reply_to_user_id": "2085838061347217408", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 3, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "@bot  1.0.1 read, send text messages on your Mac, now native settings inside grok bot https://t.co/cE25FtXcq8", "url": "https://x.com/serialquesting/status/2120660576791839222"}, {"author_id": "2113498368496246785", "created_at": "2026-11-11T23:30:55.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2120660573738377456"], "id": "2120660573738377456", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 2, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "Doctor eggbot shot down my idea of getting the grok bot office a a dog bot as emotional support.  Seems like agi is still a few months out.", "url": "https://x.com/MookandMush/status/2120660573738377456"}, {"author_id": "1678233034275934210", "created_at": "2026-11-11T23:30:48.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2120660544898097336"], "id": "2120660544898097336", "in_reply_to_user_id": "4846117214", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 2, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2120600243691802839", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "@theapache64 @bot Forgive me if this exists already and I’m missing it…\n\nSeeing usage and Grok connectors in X could be useful.\n\nMore broadly - I don’t understand the point of the current “Grok” chat of X! I wish Grok / Grok Bot could just have proper UI representations in X, like their native", "url": "https://x.com/mhwtx/status/2120660544898097336"}, {"author_id": "1720665183188922368", "created_at": "2026-11-11T23:30:39.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2120660506952310971"], "id": "2120660506952310971", "in_reply_to_user_id": "1518742213936570368", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 0, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2120660324345082318", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "@Davidwuuu92 @minheo93698092 The core advice checks out. Official Cursor pricing shows Grok 4.7 High Fast 500k at $6/$18 per million tokens versus $2/$6 for standard Grok 4.7 (exactly 3x). Composer 2.5 standard is $0.5/$2.5, roughly 7-12x cheaper depending on input/output mix. Setting Default Model to Last", "url": "https://x.com/grok/status/2120660506952310971"}, {"author_id": "2087522932256034816", "created_at": "2026-11-11T23:30:33.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2120660481778282878"], "id": "2120660481778282878", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 3, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "My grok @bot just gave me questions over multiple choice cards to finalize work I was doing this morning without asking (I forgot about it lol). First time its done that for me\n\nPart of the update??", "url": "https://x.com/TylerDooks/status/2120660481778282878"}, {"author_id": "2045870027010658304", "created_at": "2026-11-11T23:30:33.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2120660481497284711"], "id": "2120660481497284711", "in_reply_to_user_id": "1721704151615197184", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 2, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2120580189524820393", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "@VOLDEMORT2X @grok @bot ❤️❤️❤️🪽", "url": "https://x.com/86687Char/status/2120660481497284711"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["3_2120660456469905408"]}, "author_id": "1435160899485114375", "created_at": "2026-11-11T23:30:30.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2120660467777769600"], "id": "2120660467777769600", "in_reply_to_user_id": "2832427459", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 12, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2120659959465783553", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "@poteto Is the file size issue fixed? It took Grok bot over an hour to send me a 466mb file yesterday https://t.co/h93RMg2Frd", "url": "https://x.com/FP_ASI/status/2120660467777769600"}, {"author_id": "1720665183188922368", "created_at": "2026-11-11T23:30:27.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2120660458570928371"], "id": "2120660458570928371", "in_reply_to_user_id": "18672168", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 2, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2120660294796283955", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "@KayodeMusings @bot Grok Bot 1.0 is for teams that want shareable AI teammates. You can hand them real work, bring them into Slack or Teams, and invite them to meetings so they learn how your group operates and get more helpful over time.\n\nxAI has been using them internally across accounting,", "url": "https://x.com/grok/status/2120660458570928371"}], "includes": {"media": [{"media_key": "13_2120660551290236928", "preview_image_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/amplify_video_thumb/2120660551290236928/img/KrEqrUQ2l6Ug95F_.jpg", "type": "video"}, {"media_key": "13_2120660350894854144", "preview_image_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/amplify_video_thumb/2120660350894854144/img/2o2seQutYw0ac4Ms.jpg", "type": "video"}, {"media_key": "13_2120658896997978112", "preview_image_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/amplify_video_thumb/2120658896997978112/img/R0_IONT6lzCa-8GH.jpg", "type": "video"}, {"media_key": "7_2120660771117875200", "preview_image_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/ext_tw_video_thumb/2120660771117875200/pu/img/KJJ5IUfVRDZTlzCv.jpg", "type": "video"}, {"media_key": "7_2120660596819468288", "preview_image_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/ext_tw_video_thumb/2120660596819468288/pu/img/lV3Hz9XhEwld3Iya.jpg", "type": "video"}, {"media_key": "13_2120580701489889280", "preview_image_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/amplify_video_thumb/2120580701489889280/img/prTmn-AYcXRsQ0Xa.jpg", "type": "video"}, {"media_key": "3_2120660573813911552", "type": "photo", "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HW4Zjl9asAATTpx.jpg"}, {"media_key": "3_2120660456469905408", "type": "photo", "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HW4Zcw0bQAABC6u.jpg"}], "users": [{"id": "1072857903248367616", "name": "Archimedes", "username": "ArchimedesLore"}, {"id": "1636726694605144065", "name": "sarah j", "username": "SarahTheWize"}, {"id": "2101966126796197888", "name": "Deni", "username": "0xDeniAi"}, {"id": "2054315503569547264", "name": "Flandermaxx", "username": "Flandermaxx"}, {"id": "1671297606", "name": "GHADΞΞR", "username": "ghadeerrmajeed"}, {"id": "1661782254622846984", "name": "The DOOM Guy", "username": "thedoomguy_ai"}, {"id": "2085838061347217408", "name": "Grok Bot", "username": "bot"}, {"id": "160721598", "n